error[E0477]: `pinned` is said twice
  --> tests/programs/c/pinned/e0477_pinned.la:2:28
  |
2 |     let r = scope s pinned pinned {};
  |                            ^^^^^^
  |
  = help: a scope's settings come between its name and its body, each at most once: `scope conns independent limit 100 { … }`

